<title>THAILAND: Lanna unit in 10 bln baht Thai natgas deal.</title>
<headline>Lanna unit in 10 bln baht Thai natgas deal.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gulf Generation Co Ltd, a unit of Lanna Lignite Plc, on Tuesday signed an agreement to buy natural gas worth 10 billion baht ($384 million) from state-run Petroleum Authority of Thailand (PTT), an official said.</p>
</text>
